# Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with the default core.autocrlf=true converts
# every file to CRLF, and two things break that pass everywhere else:
#   - prettier (endOfLine: "lf") flags all 53 source files as unformatted
#   - bash refuses scripts/scrub-check.sh with a "\r: command not found" error
# Both were observed on windows-latest in this repo's first CI run.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish files git should never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
